  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog 0.0.121\n\n## Changes (initial history)\n\n- AR-11.3: Add cross-target CLI acceptance checks (`3f8b404`)\n- AR-11.2: Write portable SDK v1 reference (`c232e54`)\n- AR-11.1: Quarantine transitional sample APIs (`e546435`)\n- AR-10.3: Evaluate NES HUD path (`a2e8590`)\n- AR-10.2: Add Game Boy Window HUD (`8abce7d`)\n- AR-10.1: Add HUD capability checks (`8da6ac3`)\n- AR-9.4: Add cross-target sample (`4f8a870`)\n- AR-9.3: Add NES camera map spike (`76dde82`)\n- AR-9.2: Add NES logical sprite spike (`ba15944`)\n- AR-9.1: Add NES tick input operation (`e140966`)\n- AR-8.3: Migrate runner to world collision (`df150b3`)\n- AR-8.2: Add AABB tile collision query (`0cfe595`)\n- AR-8.1: Add world tile flag query (`1cf05f3`)\n- AR-7.3: Migrate runner animation constants (`6e02fe3`)\n- AR-7.2: Add frame lookup helper (`dc45ae6`)\n- AR-7.1: Add animation clip resource data (`1a8f002`)\n- AR-6.3: Add logical palette slot selection (`e6a918e`)\n- AR-6.2: Replace raw flip flags in portable API (`195744f`)\n- AR-6.1: Define portable sprite metadata (`44f6961`)\n- AR-5.3: Validate diagonal camera write budgets (`b6f04c7`)\n- AR-5.2: Add Game Boy row streaming (`6645dfe`)\n- AR-5.1: Extend Game Boy camera state to Y (`8ca849c`)\n- AR-4.3: Migrate Game Boy runner to camera_set_position (`ebe6155`)\n- AR-4.2: Reuse Game Boy camera movement for camera_set_position (`da1eb80`)\n- AR-4.1: Add camera_set_position SDK boundary (`9d1a707`)\n- AR-3.4: Generate Game Boy collision flags from world map (`0169e34`)\n- AR-3.3: Generate Game Boy streaming data from world map (`4c97f7b`)\n- AR-3.2: Generate initial Game Boy map from world data (`151033c`)\n- AR-3.1: Define portable world map structures (`96fd91c`)\n- AR-2.3: Lower WaitFrame through the Game Boy SDK path (`67e3931`)\n- AR-2.2: Add an operation creation boundary (`b7985ba`)\n- AR-2.1: Add SDK operation records (`4bef363`)\n- AR-1.4: Add capability error formatting (`64d990e`)\n- AR-1.3: Add NES capabilities (`5ffac53`)\n- AR-1.2: Add Game Boy capabilities (`0d2e00d`)\n- AR-1.1: Add capability model types (`ec05abd`)\n- docs: add autonomous roadmap execution workflow (`e9a860f`)\n- fix: improve game boy runner camera collision (`97537c5`)\n- feat: support helper functions in console samples (`d9b7166`)\n- fix: improve game boy sample gameplay (`4218e8d`)\n- chore: migrate solution to .NET 10 (`420a09b`)\n- fix: settle game boy joypad reads (`6fa2c19`)\n- feat: improve game boy runner controls and sprites (`90f2a96`)\n- docs: prioritize playable runner gaps (`eda3671`)\n- docs: record game boy runner roadmap (`2316290`)\n- feat: add game boy jump input (`80d4747`)\n- feat: add game boy map collision (`4e06dab`)\n- feat: add mario runner animation (`d583c30`)\n- feat: add game boy png sprite assets (`530cbed`)\n- chore: update z80dotnet submodule (`c370073`)\n",
